<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><variables><variable id="#Z`XkL@l`SuH3L_~BY#8">GameOn</variable><variable id="Q`D{uD]q~Z7,84ExW{#G">PlayerNumber</variable><variable id="x.q?.AgBbW822w-_mZTC">DONOTPASSGO</variable><variable id="*U:gmQCZ@?XRbr]0Y[@r">LastPlayer</variable><variable id="dr4bPOL$V#%Ri~wtpp+C">AnsweringNow</variable></variables><comment id="=*CX}O{*#jFqsgz~UM,_" x="41" y="-1099" w="778" h="237">Both code series are shown, player and referee.  To run successfully, you will need to separate these into 2 projects, as they cannot run together within the same workspace.
Each player is given a player number, so that code block will need to be updated for each team's MicroBit.  To make each additional player buzzer, use the same blocks and change set PlayerNumber to 1 to 2, 3, and so on.
The Radio set group has been randomly assigned to Group 3, change as needed (make sure all MicroBits are on the same one).
Player Buzzer Button: A - answer attempt
Referee Buzzer Buttons: A - wrong answer, B - correct answer, A+B - round reset </comment><block type="pxt-on-start" id="j,#6hVO~ve}[v$nnrO{#" x="83" y="-699"><comment pinned="true" h="62" w="242">Player Buzzer Code Blocks</comment><data>{"commentRefs":[],"fieldData":{"~commentOffsetX":"-34","~commentOffsetY":"-129.55555555555554"}}</data><statement name="HANDLER"><block type="radio_set_group" id="iy4LeSbw]8^v0$ZyHI:/"><comment pinned="true" h="93" w="177">all microbits need to be set to same radio #</comment><data>{"commentRefs":[],"fieldData":{"~commentOffsetX":"-224","~commentOffsetY":"-45.111111111111086"}}</data><value name="ID"><shadow type="math_number_minmax" id=":Io3$B[3DdONBYx*ydkN"><mutation min="0" max="255" label="Id" precision="0"></mutation><field name="SLIDER">3</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="8J72e@9z:A[Xu+[3#s?s"><field name="VAR" id="Q`D{uD]q~Z7,84ExW{#G">PlayerNumber</field><comment pinned="true" h="96" w="202">different # for each MicroBit Player Buzzer 1, 2, 3 etc</comment><data>{"commentRefs":[],"fieldData":{"~commentOffsetX":"-240.66666666666666","~commentOffsetY":"7.111111111111086"}}</data><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id=":]Z@NJ+X$Etlz%1-PZN*"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="t]2;o+hZ@KCCP.ge{%lY"><field name="VAR" id="#Z`XkL@l`SuH3L_~BY#8">GameOn</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="Tt1o{(}bIy58RKwL_#5r"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="logic_boolean" id="VLp]hXiOLo,g(_aQVMy}"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="}I=u4W`|E)hWtg,R,jb4"><field name="VAR" id="x.q?.AgBbW822w-_mZTC">DONOTPASSGO</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="h7ad7WsdP%3?dD.UD[$D"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow><block type="logic_boolean" id="C!R]Ep-V)OvWt4X]gMv["><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="@3V~NrSGpe=Oy,t^-z8